%% SMT Routing Logic Decision Flow

flowchart TD
    Start([Message arrives from MQ]) --> Extract[Connector extracts<br/>MQ properties as<br/>Kafka headers]

    Extract --> SMT1[SMT 1: InsertField]
    SMT1 --> AddMeta[Add metadata:<br/>kafkaIngestTime<br/>sourceSystem=CORE_BANKING_MQ]

    AddMeta --> SMT2[SMT 2: RegexRouter]
    SMT2 --> CheckHeader{Does header<br/>messageType<br/>exist?}

    CheckHeader -->|Yes| ReadValue[Read header value]
    CheckHeader -->|No| DefaultTopic[Route to<br/>mq-unrouted-dlq]

    ReadValue --> Route{messageType<br/>value?}

    Route -->|PAYMENT_DOMESTIC| T1[Topic:<br/>PAYMENT_DOMESTIC]
    Route -->|PAYMENT_INTERNATIONAL| T2[Topic:<br/>PAYMENT_INTERNATIONAL]
    Route -->|ACCOUNT_TRANSACTION| T3[Topic:<br/>ACCOUNT_TRANSACTION]
    Route -->|FRAUD_ALERT| T4[Topic:<br/>FRAUD_ALERT]
    Route -->|Other/Unknown| DefaultTopic

    T1 --> Success([Message produced<br/>to Kafka])
    T2 --> Success
    T3 --> Success
    T4 --> Success
    DefaultTopic --> Success

    CheckHeader -.->|Processing Error| ErrorDLQ[Topic:<br/>mq-error-dlq]
    Route -.->|Serialization Error| ErrorDLQ

    style Start fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px
    style Success fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#388e3c,stroke-width:2px
    style SMT1 fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#fff
    style SMT2 fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#fff
    style CheckHeader fill:#fff3bf,stroke:#f9a825,stroke-width:2px
    style Route fill:#fff3bf,stroke:#f9a825,stroke-width:2px
    style T1 fill:#51cf66,stroke:#2b8a3e,stroke-width:2px
    style T2 fill:#51cf66,stroke:#2b8a3e,stroke-width:2px
    style T3 fill:#51cf66,stroke:#2b8a3e,stroke-width:2px
    style T4 fill:#51cf66,stroke:#2b8a3e,stroke-width:2px
    style DefaultTopic fill:#ffa94d,stroke:#e67700,stroke-width:2px
    style ErrorDLQ fill:#fa5252,stroke:#c92a2a,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
